<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hollywood Entertainment.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hollywood Entertainment.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Piper Jaffray said analyst Brent Rystrom raised Hollywood Entertainment Corp to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- cited recent low share price as well as &quot;high degree of confidence regarding our near-term earnings model expectations.&quot;</p>
<p>-- shares rose 1-1/2 to 22-3/8.</p>
</text>
